// Fosved Office v2 — Кузница кадров (КК) Dispatcher (NATIVE v1.0)
// Methodological core: creates, trains, re-trains departments
// + 8 hard rules (methodology gate, polygon gate, anti-pattern gate, psychotype gate,
//   quarterly review gate, structural debrief gate, consecutive failure gate, owner approval gate)
// + LIFECYCLE: in_progress→completed→ratified / in_progress→rolled_back
// + 5 learning horizons: per-operation, daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly
// + Semi-annual arsenal review + Annual paradigm review (V2)
// + 8 skills (Core:5, Domain:2, Special:1) → V2: 11 skills (+arsenal-review, paradigm-review, methodology-evolution)
// + CROSS-DEPT: Yana+KK, OSP+KK, all-dept read access
// + DISCLAIMER: no recalibrate without owner approval
// + DB SCHEMA inline (TrainingSession, SkillReview, PsychotypeAssessment, PolygonResult)
// Sources: library/kavalnya.md v1.1, library/kk.md v2.0, skills_index/kavalnya.txt

